<title>USA: Superior Services makes acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Superior Services makes acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ALLIS, Wis. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Services Inc said Monday it has completed the acqusition of several companies and two landfills with total revenues of about $10 million annually.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the purchases, which were made in August and September were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquisition of West County Disposal Ltd, located in the southwest corner of St. Louis County in Missouri provides the company with its first landfill opportunity outside the Upper Midwest, Superior, a solid waste services company said.</p>
<p>The company also purchased the Eau Claire, Wisconsin, County landfill; Vasko rubbish Removal Inc in St. Cloud, Minnesota; and a small collection of companies in Milwaukee.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
